{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2019b.q30.material.recovered", "text": "朱老师在美术教学的评价中，经常用如下方法： （1）对学生完成的课堂作业，用等级和评语相结合的方式进行评价。 （2）要求学生把本学期每一次作业建档保存。 （3）期末时把评价记录和作业档案相结合的方式评定学生期末美术成绩。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "37c24e9731e1e6db57ebc07bfde0f04a3700cf839f333b12a5dd17de3049e258", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1822, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1931, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "37c24e9731e1e6db57ebc07bfde0f04a3700cf839f333b12a5dd17de3049e258"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2019b.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.314.r013", "ntce.outline.314.r020", "ntce.outline.314.r023", "ntce.outline.314.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2019b.q30"], "word_count": 109, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "37c24e9731e1e6db57ebc07bfde0f04a3700cf839f333b12a5dd17de3049e258", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1822, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1931, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role"